# The oximux-core turbo module keeps its own .gitignore: its scaffolding is
# tracked, while the uBRN-generated bindings and compiled Rust inside it are not.

# Vendored xterm dist, regenerated by `npm run xterm:bundle` (also on postinstall).
# ~480 KB of third-party minified JS: generated rather than committed, since the
# WebView needs it inlined but the repo does not need to carry it.
/src/components/terminal/xterm-bundle.ts
